## Development

This project uses [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv) for dependency management and
[Ruff](https://docs.astral.sh/ruff) for linting and formatting.

```bash
uv sync --all-groups          # install all dependencies
uv run pre-commit install     # enable the git hooks
```

Tasks are defined in `pyproject.toml` and run with `poe`:

```bash
uv run poe check              # everything CI runs: lint, format, deps, tests
uv run poe test               # just the tests
uv run poe cov                # tests with a coverage report
uv run poe fix                # lint and apply safe fixes
uv run poe format             # format
uv run poe types              # type check (advisory)
{%- if use_docs %}
uv run poe docs               # preview the documentation
{%- endif %}
uv run poe --help             # list every task
```

> [!NOTE]
> Type checking uses [ty](https://github.com/astral-sh/ty), which is still
> pre-1.0. CI reports its findings but does not fail the build on them. Once ty
> reaches 1.0, drop `continue-on-error` from the `quality` job in
> `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.

